{"unit_id":"dpskk2__dsh-chatsync#card-zh","repo":"dpskk2/dsh-chatsync","commit":"55082842b249537d780fdba97f36973ce5bdd858","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"chatsync（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在多台设备间接续 DSH 工作，同步会话记录、聊天附件、会话与工作区关联、项目文件和可选设置。插件在 DSH 侧栏和设置页提供同步入口，通过 Git 仓库双向传输；冲突时按文件类型合并，并提供状态查看、范围设置与恢复修复页面。适合需要在多台电脑继续使用相同会话和项目的 DSH 用户。需要本机 Git、可访问的 Git 托管账号及私有仓库；GitHub 默认远端需 GitHub CLI。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:135-190","lib/engine/main-sync.js:281-359"]}
{"unit_id":"dpskk2__dsh-chatsync#card-en","repo":"dpskk2/dsh-chatsync","commit":"55082842b249537d780fdba97f36973ce5bdd858","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"chatsync is a DSH Web plugin for continuing work across computers. It syncs sessions, attachments, workspace links, project files, and selected settings through Git, with sidebar controls, conflict merging, status, and recovery pages. Requires local Git and a private remote; GitHub uses GitHub CLI.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:135-190","lib/engine/main-sync.js:281-359"]}
